434
00:23:41,052 --> 00:23:45,018
O yakitori misto e o yakisoba.

435
00:23:45,041 --> 00:23:49,061
Yakitori misto e yakisoba, certo?

436
00:23:49,085 --> 00:23:51,485
Vou verificar.

437
